ty: Mobile phone, DSLR, mirrorless, action cameras Warranty Period 1 Week factory defect replacement (should be in pristine condition). If you found the item you received is defective or any problem in using, please do not hesitate to contact us first and we will be gladly to attend on your concern. Thank you very much!', 'Cameras', 'Telesin', 890.0, 27, '["https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r992-lwg4yiz3wf35a4_tn","https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r98y-lqxq8x0d83esc2_tn","https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r98q-lqxq8x0d6ouc0f_tn","https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r992-lqxq8x0d3vpge1_tn","https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r98v-lqxq8x0d5a9w67_tn"]', 0.0, 0, 16);
