nd integrates Oral-B''s iconic round brush with gentle micro-vibrations for better plaque removal* and an amazing brushing experience.', 'Health & Wellness', 'Oral-B', 429.0, 82, '["https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/sg-11134207-7rdwn-lykkozv0i73677_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/db72af8312af01c0479f9ff320de6113_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/b89054f0e1babd8ff11669ea64a7b70d_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/f8015db2c22dc19c8476da310c3029eb_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/66f8b5eec42ac688abce397ff74a659a_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/b1becb227cb06288f5dc7e5e2dce32c3_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/d3c547551d89c96fcf1bb61a40e866f8_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/9619f40c3ba6e69fc2189194a3c218cd_tn","https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/file/60e4a27412adb90d0a40ad98cd7a304b_tn"]', 0.0, 0, 47);
