vailable Size: S, M, L, XL, 1X, 2X, 3X Feedback fro Customers *Im very happy with these! Im 59, 160lbs and I got a medium. Fit is great! Very high waist (if you dont fold it over) which I like. Also they are PLENTY long. *Great fit. These pants are long - I have a 33 inseam and they fit half-inch or so long (havent washed them yet) but very comfortable. Will buy again * At 183 pounds and a 44-inch hips, the XL fits perfectly (I might even be able to go down a size, but I''ll wait and see how drastically these shrink in the wash). They are not too thin, or too thick, they are wonderful! Shipping: USPS Flat Shipping Availability: In Stock! Ready to ship within 24 hours!', 'Fashion', 'Zenana', 11.9, 53, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Zenana-Womens-Plus-Stretch-Cotton-Foldover-Waist-Bootcut-Workout-Yoga-Pants_79f044df-5e15-487d-94c4-6036e8f2c335.5791910c2a671d0bde814367c60e19d3.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 29);
