othness. PERFECT FOR GIFTING: Our high quality bedding sets are elegantly crafted for a comfortable sleep &amp; lustrous shine. The variety of colours not only compliment your room decor, but also add a luxurious touch to your day-to-day life. All of it makes them one of the best decor and gifting choices for your family, coworkers and loved ones on all the occasions.', 'Home & Living', 'Amay''s', 92.7, 97, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-100-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Easily-Fit-upto-21-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Solid-California-King-White_4f167707-8335-4b0b-8788-33d7138be1fb.e2fea14195e1435e2d146df8161b46e0.jpeg"', 2.0, 2, 43);
