, our woven fabric blend is designed to give you that soft touch but with minimal shrinking to provide a perfect fit even after multiple washings.', 'Home & Living', 'Casual Nights', 20.9, 50, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Casual-Nights-Women-s-Zipper-Front-House-Dress-Sleeveless-Seersucker-Housecoat-Duster-Lounger_dad07d21-0d2c-42a9-a1af-3794ace44993_1.52c5bf04deeecd1fedc342241f6ecaf0.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 45);
