sheet 80" x 60"1 flat sheet 102" x 90"2 pillowcases 20" x 30" King Size Sheets:&nbsp;1 fitted sheet 78" x 80"1 flat sheet 102" x 105"2 pillowcases 20" x 40" Split King Sheets Size:2 fitted sheet 80" x 39"1 flat sheet 108" x 102"2 pillowcases 20" x 40" California King Sheets Size:1 fitted sheet 84" x 72"1 flat sheet 108" x 102"2 pillowcases 20" x 40" RV Short Queen Sheets Size:1 flat sheet 99" x 90"1 fitted sheet 75" x 60"2 pillowcases 20" x 30"', 'Home & Living', 'Clara Clark', 23.0, 58, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Clara-Clark-Twin-Size-Deep-Pocket-3-Piece-Bed-Sheets-Set-1800-Series-Hotel-Luxury-Soft-Microfiber-Brown_e597136d-cf7a-4d1a-9747-35c9f0bdcda4.8f39893626fccb12e319765099291753.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 16);
