FOR GIFTING: Our high quality bedding sets are elegantly crafted for a comfortable sleep &amp; lustrous shine. The variety of colours not only compliment your room decor, but also add a luxurious touch to your day-to-day life. All of it makes them one of the best decor and gifting choices for your family, coworkers and loved ones on all the occasions.', 'Home & Living', 'Amay''s', 92.7, 78, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-100-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Easily-Fit-upto-21-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Solid-King-Light-Blue_452cb4b8-8cb7-4fe1-b26d-775d63a82a58.0915815ffb34d7db2a24b463903e261c.jpeg"', 4.33, 3, 9);
