INSERT INTO product (id, name, description, category, brand, price, stock, main_image, rating, review_count, seller_id) VALUES (1265, 'Beverly Hills Polo Club Girls School Uniform Skirt - 2 Pack Performance Scooter Skort for Girls, 4-16', 'OFFICIALLY LICENSED BEVERLY HILLS POLO CLUB: Girls'' School Uniform Scooter Skorts; Inspired by both the elegance and glamour of Beverly Hills as well as the heritage sport of polo, the Brand captures the excitement of this competitive sport along with membership in an exclusive social club VERSATILE SCHOOL UNIFORM OPTION: Perfect for girls who want to express their individual style while adhering to school dress codes, our skort is a versatile and practical choice. For girls just sitting in class or during extracurricular activities, she''ll stay comfortable and chic in our Beverly Hills Polo Club skort. STYLISH POCKET AND PLEATED DESIGNS: Elevate her school uniform with our skort, available in both pocket and pleated designs. If she prefers the convenience of pockets or the classic elegance of pleats, she''ll look and feel her best in our versatile and stylish skort. PERFORMANCE: Crafted from a moisture-wicking, breathable, and lightweight polyester fabric, this skort ensures comfort and mobility for every activity, from classroom lessons to playground adventures. Designed to withstand the demands of the school day and beyond, it''s the perfect choice for active girls who want both style and functionality in their uniform attire. COMFORTABLE FIT: Designed with her comfort in mind, our skort features a comfortable elastic waistband that ensures a secure and personalized fit. Whether she''s sitting in class or running around the playground, she''ll feel confident and at ease in our Beverly Hills Polo Club Girls'' School Uniform Skort.', 'Home & Living', 'Beverly Hills Polo Club', 20.0, 12, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Beverly-Hills-Polo-Club-Girls-School-Uniform-Skirt-2-Pack-Performance-Scooter-Skort-for-Girls-4-16_3743a9ec-