e carefully and choose the size that suits your sofas.', 'Home & Living', 'SANMADROLA', 26.0, 71, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Sanmadrola-100-Waterproof-Couch-Covers-Non-Slip-Sofa-Cover-Elastic-Straps-Silicone-Backing-Pocket-Washable-Furniture-Protector-Slipcovers-Kids-Pets-D_285a92d6-8e41-4e0f-ab51-2d88893b1363.e2b08105f7c8a50990fe8a574414ad83.jpeg"', 4.0, 1, 36);
