INSERT INTO product (id, name, description, category, brand, price, stock, main_image, rating, review_count, seller_id) VALUES (1327, 'IBTOM CASTLE Boys Prince Charming Costume Halloween Cosplay Prince Dress up Birthday Party Medieval Royal Prince Outfits for Toddler Kids 3-4 Years 4pcs Light Blue', 'Toddler Kids Boys Prince Charming Costume: Kid''s snow white cinderella prince charming costume comes with a white tunic top with gold accents, red pants, and a gold belt, plus with a crown headband/truncheon/rose to complete the overall look. This outfit to recreate the look straight from the classic Disney animated film. It will take boys back to the renaissance era to rule the land far and wide during dress-up play. Comfortable Fabric: King costume for boys, carnival party cosplay kids boys prince charming costume is made of select high grade fabric, natural and healthy material, skin-friendly, breathable, no irritation to your boy''s tender skin, provides your kid''s all day long comfort. With fabrics that feel like actual clothing and realistic details, you''ll love this costume''s look as well as its durability and wearability. Exquisite design: Long sleeve tops, stand collar and shoulders are decorated with golden epaulets. Front buttons closure for easy and convenient putting on and taking off. A pair of pants with elastic waistband for comfortable fitting, and featured gold satin stripes down the side. You''ll love that it''s got just the right amount of detailing, from the satin collar and epaulets to stunning accents, paired with pants and a belt, this outfit will make your child look like a real the prince! Occasion: Perfect for kids'' Halloween costumes, theme parties, world book day, dress up, trick-or-treating, birthday, role play, stage performances, masquerades, carnival, Christmas, photo shooting. Cinderella prince charming costume is the perfect way get your child dressed up for fairytale fun! Prince charming dress up will make your children outstandi