We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!', 'Home & Living', 'Walensee', 22.0, 55, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Walensee-Non-Slip-Bathroom-Rugs-Chenille-Soft-Striped-Plush-Bath-Mat-20-x32-Red_daa4b2d9-f3b9-4251-9415-2f11bbf0440c.8e60ee991aa5c48cd2bc4cabb3129dc5.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 26);
