random, we couldn''t make sure of the position of the floral print on each dress, but they are made of the same pattern fabric. 5. The soft fabrics may wrinkle during packaging and transportation.', 'Home & Living', 'CRAYNER', 17.0, 19, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/CRAYNER-Women-Summer-Short-Sleeve-Dresses-Casual-Swing-Cold-Shoulder-T-Shirt-Dresses-Sundress-with-Pockets_30a49946-fc89-4335-bf4b-bac33d4d7e4a.ea88cd81fa97edfa37271a70a43867f4.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 37);
