 that we offer free return service. We also provide it with a life time free customer service. If you find that our products have quality problems, just contact us and we will solve the problem for you immediately.', 'Home & Living', 'NT Bay', 18.0, 68, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ntbay-Premium-1800-Series-Microfiber-Queen-Fitted-Sheet-with-Deep-Pocket-Ultra-Soft-and-Breathable-Fitted-Bed-Sheet-60x80-inches-Mint_f2363e69-c9dd-4a67-89ca-33b0cc15a425.1b2a378ac68f10f7a986dafb9d62c213.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 35);
