nsatisfied for any reason please contact us so that we can be of assistance.', 'Home & Living', 'VIP Jeans', 15.0, 62, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/VIP-JEANS-Teen-Girls-s-Size-Skinny-Sleeveless-Zip-Jumpsuit-Romper-Black-Denim-Plus-24W_391cd847-caab-4fdb-94c9-79c0cd0fa86b.0301e2dba5629f3ea16ce44d040776f6.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 6);
