ly dry fully with air. Visit the 7-MAT store for more premium and functional indoor outdoor rugs and mats at reasonable prices.', 'Home & Living', 'SIXHOME', 17.0, 23, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SIXHOME-Outdoor-Mat-Non-Slip-Doormat-17-x30-Front-Door-Absorbent-Rubber-Welcome-Low-Profile-Dirt-Trapper-Indoor-Thick-Crosshatch-Entryway-Rug-Floor-G_8e669fa7-9a1c-4e30-a705-37339f7e6eec.aeb4018a658102761e9dd90f65202a05.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 36);
