yne Collection', 33.0, 23, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wedding-Ring-Set-for-Women-Halo-CZ-14-Kt-Gold-Sterling-Silver-Engagement-Ring-Ginger-Lyne-Collection_c61f0f27-6847-44b1-b862-9c9c52f1e63b.581cae38de600676651a04cb158cb3e7.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 5);
