work, comfortable to wear around the house or out and about can be dressed up with some dark pants and jewelry.&nbsp;', 'Home & Living', 'Fantaslook', 18.0, 52, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-Sweatshirt-for-Women-Long-Sleeve-Tunic-Tops-Color-Block-Crewneck-Sweatshirts-Side-Split_2a427e7c-e0e9-4813-adc8-0a57bdc22c6b.d39930fd45e2d4f3a6a05d4c062b9572.jpeg"', 4.0, 1, 35);
