ay at the beach or a street-style statement, this womens tunic tops is designed to accompany you wherever life takes you.', 'Home & Living', 'Fantaslook', 15.0, 58, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-Blouses-for-Women-Pleated-Short-Sleeve-Tunic-Tops-Dressy-Casual-Summer-Shirts_1a5d6f65-e08f-4996-b263-42e81556743d.07dd4fd3997a8585d87094559a88ca3b.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 47);
