They strike a perfect balance between comfort and an elegant look, allowing for versatile and chic outfit combinations', 'Home & Living', 'MOSHU', 10.0, 11, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/MOSHU-Blouses-for-Women-Dressy-Casual-Button-Down-Shirts-Ruffle-Sleeve-V-Neck-Womens-Tops_622376d8-7477-405e-8e35-4dad1d41f0a0.12e0a5103b88478cf0f6f9d274b95f66.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 6);
