wear or pajamas. Elevate your indoor fashion game with these eye-catching slippers that exude a playful and charming vibe, setting you apart with their unique and endearing design. Indulge in the luxurious comfort and style offered by the BERANMEY Cute Smile Face Slippers for Women. Upgrade your at-home experience with these irresistibly fluffy, non-slip slippers that promise to keep your feet snug and your spirits high. Experience the perfect blend of warmth, comfort, and cuteness with these smile face slippers that are sure to become your favorite indoor companions.', 'Home & Living', 'BERANMEY', 14.0, 81, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/BERANMEY-Cute-Smile-Face-Slippers-Women-Perfect-Soft-Plush-Comfy-Warm-Slip-On-Happy-fo-Indoor-fluffy-House-Men-Non-slip-Fuzzy-Flat-Slides_8c718034-b188-44d6-aa10-cb54553df289.f8765fa8e339dc317cbf89eb10aa56b6.jpeg"', 5.0, 1, 35);
