rty, Easter, Carnival, Children''s Day, bridesmaid, school dance prom, photograph props, photo shoot, ceremony, holiday, vacation, beach, performance, show, graduation, boutique or other special occasions.', 'Home & Living', 'Ibtom Castle', 29.0, 33, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/IBTOM-CASTLE-Little-Big-Girls-Flower-Vintage-Floral-Lace-3-4-Sleeves-Floor-Length-Dress-Wedding-Party-Evening-Formal-Pageant-Dance-Gown-7-8-Years-Dar_220b16f9-10ca-4a5d-8623-e02962f19fd9.429d083999e72680f99738fdecbad8b2.png"', 0.0, 0, 26);
INSERT INTO product (id, name, description, category, brand, price, stock, main_image, rating, review_count, seller_id) VALUES (1744, 'ZZwxWA Today Discount Dressy Tank Top for Women, Women''s Seamless Suspender with Added Velvet and Thick Back Protection Bottom Coat Tank Tops Round Neck Tank Tops Summer Saving', 'Dive into the vibrant energy of summer with our collection of chic and comfortable vests. Crafted from high-quality, breathable materials, our vests are designed to keep you cool and stylish under the scorching sun. Whether you''re hitting the beach, strolling through the city, or enjoying a backyard barbecue, our vests come in a variety of colors and patterns to match your unique style. With their lightweight design and eye-catching appeal, our vests are the perfect addition to your summer wardrobe. Don''t miss out on the chance to make a statement this season choose from our selection and stay cool with fashion! As the temperature rises, keep your fashion game on point with our trendy vests. Our designs blend comfort with style, ensuring that you stay ahead of the curve while beating the heat. With a range of sizes to fit every body type, our vests are the ultimate summer staple. From casual to athletic, we''ve got you covered with vests that cater to all your summer activities. The soft, breathable fabric ensures that you stay comfortable all day long, while the bold prints and colors will have you turning heads wherever you go. Make a splash this summer and upgrade your wardrobe with our fashionable vests! The summer season is all about enjoying the warm weather, and our vest collection is here to enhance that experience. Our vests are made with the finest materials that offer a blend of comfort and durability, ensuring that you can enjoy the outdoors for longer periods without feeling weighed down. The moisture-wicking properties of our fabric keep you dry even on the hottest days, while the stylish cuts and fits provide a flattering look for any occasion. Whether you''re lounging by the pool or exploring the city, our vests are the perfect companion for those long, sun-soaked days. Make the most of the summer with our comfortable and stylish vests! Summer is the time to show off your fashion sense, and our vests are just what you need to make a bold statement. With a wide range of designs, from classic to contemporary, our vests are sure to elevate your style quotient. The versatile nature of our vests allows you to pair them with anything from shorts to jeans, creating endless outfit possibilities. The attention to detail in our designs, coupled with the use of premium fabrics, ensures that you not only look good but feel good too. Step out in confidence with our dazzling vests and let your style do the talking this summer! The key to a successful summer wardrobe is versatility, and our vests are the ultimate wardrobe enhancer. They''re easy to mix and match with your existing pieces, allowing you to create fresh, new looks for every occasion. Whether you''re dressing up for a summer party or keeping it casual for a day by the water, our vests add a touch of sophistication and style to any ensemble. With a variety of colors and patterns to choose from, you''re sure to find the perfect vest to express your personal style. Don''t let the summer pass you by revamp your wardrobe with our must-have vests and make every day a fashion statement!', 'Home & Living', 'ZZwxWA', 4.29, 42, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/ZZwxWA-Today-Discount-Dressy-Tank-Top-Women-Women-s-Seamless-Suspender-Added-Velvet-Thick-Back-Protection-Bottom-Coat-Tops-Round-Neck-Summer-Saving_688d65d3-bc25-4e11-973e-c759a1c40e8d.d12cb3bd967e0aa703dafe3d535b1f78.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 41);
