INSERT INTO product (id, name, description, category, brand, price, stock, main_image, rating, review_count, seller_id) VALUES (1762, 'Fantaslook U Neck Tank Top for Women Sleeveless Split Curved Hem Tunic Tops Summer Casual Tank Tops', 'HIGH QUALITYThe tank top for women is composed of 35% Rayon, 60% Polyester and 5% Spandex. The knitting process gives full softness and comfort, and the skin-friendly fabric is breathable. Fabric is soft, comfortable and elastic, which can provide all-day relaxation and comfort, while maintaining the shape of this sleeveless tops for women and highlighting the perfect figure. BASE&nbsp; DESIGNThe womens summer tank tops adopts U-neck and sleeveless design, and the simple design makes this casual tank tops for women an eternal classic. Side split and circular hem design, more suitable for various body shapes. The sleeveless tunic top is long enough to cover your hips and can hide belly fat well. Simple tailoring balances the needs of comfort and fashion. CLASSIC FEATUREStank top for women/womens tank tops/womens summer tops/summer tops for women/womens tops/womens clothes/womens tops/tops for women/tunic tops for women/tank tops women/summer tops/sleeveless tops for women/womens sleeveless tops/women summer sleeveless basic top/U neck tank top women/tank tops for women/casual tank tops for women/curved hem womens tops/women basic sleeveless vest crop tank top/split side tank tops for women/basic tops FASHION MATCHThe split side tank tops for women is fashionable and versatile, can be perfectly matched with all kinds of bottoms, such as jeans, leggings, shorts and skirts. The casual tops for women can be worn alone, is an essential item in summer. This basic sleeveless tank top also can be matched with cardigan, jacket or coat to create a fashionable spring and autumn style. DIFFERENT OCCASIONThe womens tops are very suitable for sports, work, shopping, beach walking, exercise, going out and daily leisure clothing.&nbsp; This sleeveless summer basic tops for women is simple and classic, and different fashion styles can be created according to different occasions.', 'Home & Living', 'Fantaslook', 13.0, 45, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-U-Neck-Tank-Top-for-Women-Sleeveless-Split-Curved-Hem-Tunic-Tops-Summer-Casual-Tank-Tops_13a7d515-4035-4fc1-9573-6ada2197cd96.52acd1c404642c077a2effc4162332cf.png"', 0.0, 0, 10);
