bsp;father,&nbsp;husband,&nbsp;son,&nbsp;or&nbsp;friends. Care&nbsp;Instructions:&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;washable.&nbsp;Iron&nbsp;the&nbsp;mariachi&nbsp;shirt&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;low&nbsp;temperature&nbsp;if&nbsp;necessary.&nbsp;If&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;well-defined&nbsp;muscles,&nbsp;we&nbsp;recommend&nbsp;choosing&nbsp;one&nbsp;size&nbsp;larger&nbsp;than&nbsp;your&nbsp;usual&nbsp;size&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;more&nbsp;comfortable&nbsp;fit.', 'Home & Living', 'Coevals Club', 30.0, 13, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/COEVALS-CLUB-Men-s-Embroidered-Western-Cowboy-Long-Sleeve-Pearl-Snap-Two-Pockets-Casual-Button-up-Shirts-Black-2-01-XX-Large_9a613376-d020-4fe9-807c-831f7d04d47e.8dcc20795506d4ccd4aff87eca5b6e52.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 5);
