ens of electronic devices, the colors may be slightly different. Q5: If you are not happy from the service ? Answer: Directly contact with us before writing a negative review . We are trying to help all of our customers. You may be sure that we will try do our best for your satisfaction .', 'Fashion', 'CALIPESSA', 15.0, 91, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/CALIPESSA-Womens-Navy-Blue-Crease-Detail-Skinny-Leggings-Elastic-Waist-Casual-Solid-Pencil-Pants_70265fc2-1842-4927-9ea2-6c1dc7c193e0.77beff80e0e1fa3cf0b5fb4b5d0ca0ad.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 16);
