 (Pillows are not included) Care Instruction: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, tumble dry at low temperature, cool iron if needed. Do not bleach. Satisfactory Sales Service: We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer free return service. We also provide it with a life time free customer service. If you find that our products have quality problems, just contact us and we will solve the problem for you immediately.', 'Furniture', 'NT Bay', 40.0, 40, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ntbay-5-Piece-Bedding-Twin-Comforter-Set-Ultra-Soft-Breathable-Bed-A-Bag-Includes-Comforter-Fitted-Sheet-Flat-Top-Sheet-2-Envelope-Pillowcase-Black_6f8e2cc6-ff0d-4e1b-ad9a-21011c4c4035.42699406ae9e05dc2044208eb572a745.jpeg"', 3.0, 2, 32);
