e of ice silk,which is cool and breathable. What''s more,our cooling pillow are removable zipper for easy cleaning. All materials are designed to promote health. Rest Assured to Buy, No-worry After-sales SupportSleep with a DONAMA neck pillow and you''ll be one step closer to your dream.Our support pillow is a very good choice, we strive to product quality, ensure your shopping experience.This is a great gift for yourself, your parents, friends and colleagues. If you have any questions about this, please feel free to contact DONAMA customer service, we will contact you within 24 hours. We will do our best to provide you with a satisfactory experience.', 'Furniture', 'DONAMA', 30.0, 70, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/DONAMA-Cervical-Neck-Pillow-Pain-Relief-Sleeping-Memory-Foam-Breathable-Pillowcase-Orthopedic-Ergonomic-Contoured-Support-Side-Back-Stomach-Queen-Siz_8709b0f7-e42e-4652-ab75-014ea02621a5.65ce683906614896c75714e7efc1e954.jpeg"', 2.0, 2, 35);
