ease wear gloves to assemble the shed.', 'Home & Living', 'Aiho', 160.0, 39, '"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Aiho-6-x-4-Shed-on-Clearance-Outdoor-Storage-Shed-with-Metal-Base-Frame-Air-Vent-Lockable-Doors-for-Garden-and-Backyard-Grey_cc8c0076-8a9f-41c0-9d73-a277078f7b03.44d1bb591742888e6c4af76185cf6236.jpeg"', 0.0, 0, 6);
